{"product_id":"camping-catastrophe","title":"Camping Catastrophe","description":"\u003cp\u003eEveryone's favorite first grader is in the midst of another catastrophe!Max, the biggest bully in first grade, just can't believe that Freddy Thresher and his best friend, Robbie, are going on a camping trip this weekend. Worse yet, Freddy's sister, Suzie, has bet him a full week's worth of chores that he'll be too much of a scaredy-cat to spend the whole night in the wild! And, even though Freddy is a little bit worried, he sure isn't going to let Suzie win a bet that involves cleaning the basement!\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 165 x 193\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Abby Klein\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780439895941\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 96\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45898399482009,"sku":"17RE-2-9780439895941","price":10.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/69181fe7ca408_Camping_Catastrophe.jpg?v=1763202618","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/camping-catastrophe","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}